jsonable
def jsonable(
    o
):
Make a value JSON-friendly for json.dumps: sequences become lists, numpy scalars numbers, and anything else a string.

Fitting, storing, switching on
Logging, fitting and switching on are separate calls, so nothing changes retrieval by accident. learn() starts the log, training_data turns it into rows grouped by question, fit_ranker and fit_noise fit, and use_ranker and use_noise switch the stored models on. Whether a ranker should be on for a collection is a question for evals/.


